    {
      "key": "hud.help_fly",
      "text": " · Right-click: mode action (within {0:0.#} cells of the character, instant, no walking) · F: collect dropped items (within {1:0.#} cells) · 1–4 / Alt + mouse wheel: choose block type · Fly camera: WASD, Q/E, hold middle mouse (mode keys off while flying) · stop flying to dig/place · F3: back to character\n"
    },
    {
      "key": "hud.help_idle",
      "text": " · No character: mode keys off · 1–4 / Alt + mouse wheel: choose block type · WASD, Q/E, hold middle mouse: camera · stop flying to dig/place\n"
    },
    {
      "key": "hud.help_walk",
      "text": " · Left-click: walk to the clicked spot (hold to follow the cursor) · left-click a plot: show its panel · A: jump · Shift: dash · Right-click: mode action / harvest / open storage / pick up (target within {0:0.#} cells, walks to {1:0.#} cells then acts) · F: collect dropped items (within {2:0.#} cells) · B: bag (click an item to hold it) · 1–4 / Alt + mouse wheel: choose block type · hold middle mouse: rotate · mouse wheel: zoom · Space: camera behind character · X: first-person view · F3: fly camera\n"
    },
